 ious return of the Bowiest of Showies! Niki Starbust Luparelli and her all
  grrrl Total Blam Blam David Boobie Band bring to the Crystal Ballroom the
 ir yearly tribute to the King of Glitter Rock! Rather than pushing through
  the market square on Black Friday Weekend\, driving like a demon from sta
 tion to station\, and running wild through a million dead end streets in s
 earch of Christmas bargains\, you should instead spit in the eyes of fools
 \, put on your red shoes\, and run to the centre of things\, the Crystal B
 allroom\, that is\, where each table offers a seat with the clearest view\
 , and femme fatales emerge from shadows\, dancing to the best of Bowie\, A
