SUMMARY:Boston Celtic Music Festival 2027
LOCATION:The Rockwell\, 255 Elm St\, Somerville\, MA 02144
DESCRIPTION:The 24th annual Boston Celtic Music Festival presented by Passi
 m\, known as BCMFest\, returns to Club Passim\, Somerville Theatre\, Cryst
 al Ballroom\, Arts at the Armory\, and The Rockwell January 14-17\, 2027. 
 Presented by Passim\, a Cambridge-based non-profit that supports a vibrant
  music community through Club Passim\, the Passim School of Music\, artist
  grants and outreach initiatives. The 2027 festival will showcase Greater 
 Boston’s deep tradition of music\, song and dance from Irish\, Scottish\
 , Cape Breton\, Quebecois and other Celtic communities. BCMFest features a
 cts that are traditional as well as others that draw on contemporary sound
 s and ideas\; full-time\, professional touring acts as well as local sessi
 on musicians\; highlighting performers from across the generations.\nhttps
 ://therockwell.org/calendar/boston-celtic-music-festival-2027/\nFrom Pushp
 in Boston: https://pushpin.city/
URL:https://therockwell.org/calendar/boston-celtic-music-festival-2027/
END:VEVENT
